                        "description": "### Get task's status and progress\n\nRetrieves the current status and progress of a background process task. To successfully fetch task details, include the task\u2019s unique ID as a path parameter in the request URL. If the request is valid and the task exists, the API returns information about the task\u2019s execution status and completion progress. This endpoint is typically used to monitor long-running or asynchronous operations."
